{"id":"2b59f947b2d0","path":"/en/university/organisation/structure/commissions/research-commission","lang":"en","title":"Research Commission","description":"The Research Commission is a commission of the Academic Senate. It has an advisory and proposal-making function for the Senate and the Rectorate on research-related issues and a decision-making function on research grants. The Research Service provides the secretariat. Compositio","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Organisation","Organisational structure","Commissions"],"image":null,"words":81,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/organizzazione/struttura/commissioni/commissione-ricerca","en":"/en/university/organisation/structure/commissions/research-commission"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/university"},{"label":"Organisation","path":"/en/university/organisation"},{"label":"Organisational structure","path":"/en/university/organisation/structure"},{"label":"Commissions","path":"/en/university/organisation/structure/commissions"},{"label":"Research Commission","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Research Commission is a commission of the <a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/academic-senate\">Academic Senate</a>. It has an advisory and proposal-making function for the Senate and the <a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/rectorate\">Rectorate</a> on research-related issues and a decision-making function on research grants. The <a href=\"/en/originalnode/10502\">Research Service</a> provides the secretariat.</p> <p>Composition and detailed functions are specified in the relevant Rules.</p> <p><strong>Current members</strong>:</p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Raphaël Parchet","role":"President of the Research Commission","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/servizio-ricerca-parchet-raphael.jpg","html":"<p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/4ef3cd2d89a1d210dba6f99ae74b10ed/parchet-raphael\">Persona